      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2017 Wiley-VCH Verlag GmbH & Co. KGaA, Weinheim.",
        "AbstractText": "It was found that bands at 739, 963, and 1107\u2005cm-1 in the resonant Raman spectra are characteristics of framework penta-coordinated NbV -OH species, and that a band at 1336\u2005cm-1 in the UV Raman spectrum with excitation line at 320\u2005nm is a sensitive detector for identifying extra-framework niobium species. The change of framework penta-coordinated NbV -OH species into Nb+ and NbO- species due to dehydration was definitively confirmed based on UV resonance Raman and UV/Vis results."
      },
